  "id": "illogicality",
  "term": "illogicality",
  "definition": "Illogicality is the quality of an experience or thought pattern appearing internally inconsistent or not following ordinary logical structure. In this context, it refers to the seemingly nonlogical organization often reported in dream-like and psychedelic states, without implying simple cognitive impairment.",
